- Eun Gyeol!

53:27.130 --> 53:30.639
- Eun Gyeol!
- Eun Gyeol!

53:31.340 --> 53:34.840
- Eun Gyeol!
- Eun Gyeol!

53:36.340 --> 53:38.579
- Eun Gyeol!
- Alamak! Dia dah pergi!

