01:01:35.219 --> 01:01:36.519
...dan dicari-cari.

01:01:40.019 --> 01:01:41.090
Akhirnya...

01:01:42.260 --> 01:01:44.000
...saya berjaya memenangi hati gadis cantik itu.

01:01:46.059 --> 01:01:47.530
